{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117200509677-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117215156\"/><p>今晚(17日)第122期六合彩攪珠結果：4、7、18、30、42、45，特別號碼為36。頭獎無人中；二獎4注中，每注派彩440,270港元；三獎75注中，每注派彩62,610港元。</p><p>下期六合彩攪珠將於周四(11月19日)舉行，估計頭獎基金可達19,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:08.546746+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:05:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:43.202055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:30.401638+00:00","content_hash":"4541e82c4b34da9e124da9dbca91d80b167def4facd41aceabccbd6a6ef60100","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}